; tap2sna.py file for Alien 8. Run
;
;   $ tap2sna.py @alien8.t2s
;
; to create a Z80 snapshot.

https://zxaaa.net/DENIED/Alien%208%20(1985)(Ultimate%20Play%20The%20Game).tzx
Alien8.z80

--tape-name "ALIEN.tzx"
--sim-load-config accelerator=speedlock

; The Speedlock loader decrypts the game in place at its real addresses, then
; its final stub at $EE00 (LD (HL),A; LD BC,$01D0; LDIR; LD IY,$5C3A; EXX;
; IM 1; EI; LD SP,$62FC; JP $6300) hands over to the game. Stopping the
; simulation at the game's entry point ($6300: DI; LD SP,$F100; JP $A631)
; leaves the snapshot with everything at the right addresses and the loading
; screen intact.
--start 25344
--stack 25340
